WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.442
Your prompts live in the code.

2
00:00:02.442 --> 00:00:04.245
Your traces live somewhere else.

3
00:00:04.245 --> 00:00:05.075
And the bill?

4
00:00:05.075 --> 00:00:06.974
That shows up from a third place.

5
00:00:08.336 --> 00:00:09.716
Meet AcruxCore.

6
00:00:10.808 --> 00:00:14.039
One open-source platform for your whole LLM stack.

7
00:00:14.744 --> 00:00:16.376
Version every prompt.

8
00:00:16.376 --> 00:00:18.083
Diff any two versions.

9
00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:20.463
Then ship the change by moving an alias.

10
00:00:20.463 --> 00:00:21.520
No redeploy.

11
00:00:22.232 --> 00:00:23.792
Your tools get versions too.

12
00:00:23.792 --> 00:00:27.206
They run inside the gateway, and every failure is counted.

13
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.533
One endpoint in front of OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and more.

14
00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:36.055
With routing, caching, retries, and budgets.

15
00:00:36.752 --> 00:00:38.528
Every call becomes a trace.

16
00:00:38.528 --> 00:00:39.574
Automatically.

17
00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:44.821
Run evals on real datasets, and turn failures into scored fixes.

18
00:00:45.536 --> 00:00:47.529
And every change is on the record.

19
00:00:47.529 --> 00:00:48.671
On every plan.

20
00:00:49.376 --> 00:00:51.020
Apache 2.0.

21
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:55.179
Self-host it with one command, or start free on the hosted platform.

22
00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:56.923
AcruxCore.

23
00:00:56.923 --> 00:01:01.767
Prompts, tools, gateway, tracing, evals, and audit.

24
00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:02.813
One platform.
